msgid "fhir-harness's l3-fhir-pipeline.bpmn, from its StartEvent_ModelReady with the mapping above as the source model: author FSH, SUSHI, validate, QC, IG Publisher, publish. Called, not copied, so a change to the generic pipeline reaches every IG built on it."
