#: ../smart-base/processes/content/dak-l3-ig.bpmn:26
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "How a WHO SMART Guidelines L2 Digital Adaptation Kit becomes a published L3 FHIR Implementation Guide: map the DAK's L2 content to the FHIR artefacts it calls for, then run fhir-harness's generic L3 pipeline (Process_L3Fhir) with that mapping as its source model. The WHO L2 → L3 ordering lives here because fhir-harness's pipeline does not know about DAKs; that pipeline is called, not copied."
msgstr ""

